        <div class="
            comment__body
            text-styles
            text-styles--secondary
            body
            
            
          ">
          <p><strong>OriginTrace is officially live. 🛡️</strong><br>
It does 3 things:<br>
🔍<strong>Scan</strong> the web for copies of your DEV.to posts<br>
⚖️ <strong>Check</strong> whether those copies actually credited you<br>
💬 <strong>Ask the AI Agent</strong> to analyze the evidence and generate a DMCA notice when needed.<br>
So here's the fun part: <strong>if you found your own post copied tomorrow, which of these 3 would you use first? 👀</strong></p>


        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
    </script>

